{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Basics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/9a6e8845833d414c512b2621f4840f62.avif?t=1761537072\" alt=\"Players start with 100HP and a 6 card opening hand. Before turn 1 you can mulligan by Choosing unwanted cards to put back, drawing back up to 6, and reshuffling the unwanted cards back into the deck.\" width=680 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Grace System:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/e795590d90759bf5f8bf2304ff2f8de6.avif?t=1761537072\" alt=\"Ever been Mana/Energy screwed? That&#039;s no fun. We designed a system that ensures more consistent gameplay... IF you can manage it well. Introducing &amp;quot;Grace&amp;quot; the unique resource mechanic in CotR! Each card has a Grace cost that must be paid to play that card.  A &amp;quot;Roll For Grace&amp;quot; is the sum of 2 rolled d10s. There is a little luck involved, but this system is MORE consistent than other games and makes for very compelling gameplay.\" width=680 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Turn Phases</strong>: Each turn comprises four strategic stages:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/32c009c3a64e7184c6a63a6c118bc606.poster.avif?t=1761537072\" aria-label=\"Upkeep: Reset your field, harvest resources, then choose to draw once and roll once, draw twice, or roll twice. Prepare: Spend Grace to play cards from hand to field. Engage: Command your Heroes to attack or unleash their abilities. Respond: Your opponent decides how to resolve your Engage decisions and their turn begins\" width=680 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/32c009c3a64e7184c6a63a6c118bc606.webm?t=1761537072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/32c009c3a64e7184c6a63a6c118bc606.mp4?t=1761537072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incada (In-Ka-Da):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/1d60f5a7dc8a19ff128937399ba54e8f.poster.avif?t=1761537072\" width=680 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/1d60f5a7dc8a19ff128937399ba54e8f.webm?t=1761537072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/1d60f5a7dc8a19ff128937399ba54e8f.mp4?t=1761537072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directional Combat:</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/e9b105e94d9e2dfccdc385bb2f436570.avif?t=1761537072\" width=680 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/0214f34678d04c3f2021d9998811c20e.avif?t=1761537072\" width=680 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/be017bffa5dc2356e419f658ccc514a3.avif?t=1761537072\" width=680 height=604 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The digital future:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once we have completed our Kickstarter for for Physical TCG we plan on continuing this digital development and creating a 1 to 1 digital experience for our TCG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goals include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Wars support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack Purchasing/Opening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Again, Welcome to Challengers Of The Realm! Tell your friends!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059280?t=1761537072","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059280?t=1761537072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/c1824a79a51f4baf1d869dfd0525b11db3aaf522/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761537072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/c1824a79a51f4baf1d869dfd0525b11db3aaf522/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761537072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4075940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Basics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059280/extras/9a6e8845833d414c512b2621f4840f62.avif?t=1761537072\" alt=\"Players start with 100HP and a 6 card opening hand. Before turn 1 you can mulligan by Choosing unwanted cards to put back, drawing back up to 6, and reshuffling the u